        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kip is yummy. Kip is hard. Kip breaks you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/2824309abbcf851d9bfe03a53a3fb22c.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/2824309abbcf851d9bfe03a53a3fb22c.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the most punishing games ever made - Kaizo Super Mario World hacks, I Wanna Be The Guy, Super Meat Boy - Kip is a precision platformer built only the toughest players. No hand-holding. No difficulty sliders. Just Kip, a chicken with nowhere to go but go forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/5e2f42c4a47874f3c8fa649ec492cc9e.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/5e2f42c4a47874f3c8fa649ec492cc9e.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 700 levels of story mode content which is in the making, split into normal and hard variants. And if you're stuck at any time, there's a full library of legacy levels waiting for you. And if you're feeling nostalgic, you can even play the first game; Kip 1!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/e847e9cb8cf2c8e657070a4eea199c01.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/e847e9cb8cf2c8e657070a4eea199c01.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=183 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for the determined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran of the hardest platformers that exist or just a newcomer who wants to prove something. Kip meets you wherever you are. And then almost immediately makes things much, much worse. Harder variants of each level are playable, reserved for only the most masochistic players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/4a9b39ef93ec75b8fe76690ff6330255.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/4a9b39ef93ec75b8fe76690ff6330255.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=183 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight, unforgiving controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip demands a ton of precision. Every jump is a big commitment, every pixel matters and every death is a lesson. The learning curve is steep, but the moment when a level finally clicks? Worth every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's Kip it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kip is yummy. Kip is hard. Kip breaks you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/2824309abbcf851d9bfe03a53a3fb22c.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/2824309abbcf851d9bfe03a53a3fb22c.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the most punishing games ever made - Kaizo Super Mario World hacks, I Wanna Be The Guy, Super Meat Boy - Kip is a precision platformer built only the toughest players. No hand-holding. No difficulty sliders. Just Kip, a chicken with nowhere to go but go forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/5e2f42c4a47874f3c8fa649ec492cc9e.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/5e2f42c4a47874f3c8fa649ec492cc9e.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 700 levels of story mode content which is in the making, split into normal and hard variants. And if you're stuck at any time, there's a full library of legacy levels waiting for you. And if you're feeling nostalgic, you can even play the first game; Kip 1!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/e847e9cb8cf2c8e657070a4eea199c01.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/e847e9cb8cf2c8e657070a4eea199c01.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=183 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for the determined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran of the hardest platformers that exist or just a newcomer who wants to prove something. Kip meets you wherever you are. And then almost immediately makes things much, much worse. Harder variants of each level are playable, reserved for only the most masochistic players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/4a9b39ef93ec75b8fe76690ff6330255.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/4a9b39ef93ec75b8fe76690ff6330255.webp?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=183 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight, unforgiving controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip demands a ton of precision. Every jump is a big commitment, every pixel matters and every death is a lesson. The learning curve is steep, but the moment when a level finally clicks? Worth every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's Kip it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1787055183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1787055183 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p>",
